units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p f
atom_style atomic
lattice bcc 3.3
region projectile block 0 20 0 20 0 20
region target block 0 20 0 20 21.5 61.5
create_box 2 projectile
create_atoms 1 region projectile
create_atoms 2 region target
pair_style eam
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Nb Nb
velocity all create 300 12345
fix 1 all nvt temp 300 300 0.1
run 50000
unfix 1
velocity projectile set 0 0 -2000 units box
fix 2 all nve
thermo 100
run 100000
